DirectFetcherTest
├── given the request succeeds
│   ├── it reports the status
│   ├── it reports ok
│   └── it exposes the parsed body
├── given the request fails with an http error
│   └── it reports not ok without throwing
├── given the request rejects
│   └── it propagates the rejection
├── given the request outlives the timeout
│   └── it aborts the request
├── given the request finishes before the timeout
│   ├── it leaves no timer running
│   └── it never aborts the finished request
└── hardened defaults
    ├── when the caller passes no init
    │   ├── it omits credentials
    │   ├── it sends no referrer
    │   └── it bypasses the http cache
    └── when the caller tries to weaken them
        └── it overrides the caller
